x_{ij} \in \{0,1\} \quad \forall i \in \{\text{MA}, \text{MB}, \text{MC}, \text{MD}, \text{ME}, \text{MF}\},\ j \in \{\text{P1}, \text{P2}, \text{P3}, \text{P4}, \text{P5}, \text{P6}\}
